---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'November 23, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — ScreenCheck" description="ScreenCheck runs entirely in your browser. Nothing is uploaded, stored or tracked.">
  <section class="band-light" style="padding: 128px 24px;">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl animate-fade-up">
        <h1 class="text-display-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>
        <div class="legal-prose mt-8">
          <p>ScreenCheck is designed to collect as little as possible. The short version: the tool runs entirely in your browser and nothing you see on this page is sent to us.</p>
          <h2>What we collect</h2>
          <p>We do not collect personal information. There are no accounts, no sign-up forms and no contact details required to use the tool.</p>
          <h2>How the tool works</h2>
          <p>Your screen resolution, scaling, pixel ratio and refresh rate are read by JavaScript running on your device. The comparison happens locally. Those values are never transmitted to a server.</p>
          <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
          <p>The site may store a single preference in your browser's local storage: your choice of light or dark theme. That value stays on your device and is not shared.</p>
          <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
          <p>This site does not use advertising networks or behavioural tracking. If privacy-friendly, aggregate analytics are added in the future, this policy will be updated first.</p>
          <h2>Third-party links</h2>
          <p>The site may link to other websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, and we recommend reading their policies.</p>
          <h2>Children</h2>
          <p>ScreenCheck is a general-purpose utility and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone.</p>
          <h2>Changes</h2>
          <p>If this policy changes, the updated date at the top of this page will change as well.</p>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to the address listed on the About page once one is added.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>